    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">In all U.S. states with legal "rece-tional" or "adult-use" cannabis regimes, cannabis producers, distrib-utors, and retailers must obtain state licenses in order to sell legally. Licens-ing and "seed-to-sale" tracking systems help states collect taxes, monitor the</p>
