    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Conclusion</h3>
    <p>Sufficient time has passed that we can assess the broad impacts of the U.S.-China trade war on California agricultural exports. There is no evidence that this blunt policy approach has had any success and instead it has only served to harm consumers in both countries and financially injured some U.S. farmers. Although producers of almonds and</p>
